  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Brian Epley said the shift from generative to agentic AI requires bringing compute and data together, with transport being critical. He questioned the usefulness of a five-year plan because so much will change in the interim. He said AI is at the forefront of mission areas including climate measurement, resilience, and clean energy, and that efforts pivoted toward areas providing clearer outcomes. In a September 2025 Commerce Department document, he described a termination process intended to let the department remove noncompliant AI systems from operation.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4",
    "s5"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
